<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/ibn-muljam" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/ibn-muljam.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/january-26">26 January</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Ibn Muljam attacks Caliph Ali at prayer in Kufa</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Kharijite <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ibn-muljam">Ibn Muljam</a> struck the fourth <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/caliphate">caliph</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ali-ibn-abi-talib">Ali ibn Abi Talib</a>, with a poisoned sword as he prayed in the Great Mosque of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kufa">Kufa</a>. Ali died of his wounds two days later, which ended the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rashidun-caliphate">Rashidun Caliphate</a>.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ali-ibn-abi-talib">Ali ibn Abi Talib</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ibn-muljam">Ibn Muljam</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rashidun-caliphate">Rashidun Caliphate</a></div></div></li></ol></section>
